'''Island of Hidden Treasure''' (秘宝の眠る孤島, ''Hihō no Nemuru Kotō'', '''Island of Hidden Treasure''') is a daily event whose stages are guaranteed to drop [[Talent Orbs]]. This event was added in [[Version 11.8 Update|Version 11.8]], replacing [[Isle of the Map Lord]].

The stages of this event are identical to the Talent Orb [[Enigma Stages]] for all Orb types except [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] and [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]], which aren't present here.

